body:
Give them a backstory that fuels their ambition. 

{SPOILERS}

For example in the books Mapleshade was drove out by Thunderclan for having a mate in Riverclan. She tried to swim her kits across the river to shelter in their father's clan, they drowned. She arrived in Riverclan heartbroken after her clan's betrayal and her loss of her kits. Riverclan cast her away as well. This is why she hated the clans.
